'''Water Rose'''{{unofficial}} is a [[Spells|spell]] that creates a flower made of water.
==Description==
The casting seal contains a [[Sigils Explained#Water|Water]] Sigil within a [[Sigils Explained#Flower|Flower]] Sigil. There are five unknown symbols between the extended lines of the Flower Sigil, acting as modifiers to shape the spell into a specific kind of flower. The flower created by this spell appears similar to a rose.{{Ref|https://tongari-anime.com/bd-cd/novelty/}}

==Usage==
[[Qifrey]] uses this spell to demonstrate to [[Coco]] the possibilities of [[magic]].{{Ref|m|3|14}} Coco later recalls this spell when [[Agott]] shows her a [[Flowers of Light|similar one]].{{Ref|m|58|23-24}}

==Trivia==
*This spell is likely to be a [[Watersculpture]], give its use of water and a [[Decorative Sigils|Decorative Sigil]].
*The casting seal for this spell is not shown in the manga. It <i>is</i> shown on a piece of official merch.{{Ref|https://tongari-anime.com/bd-cd/novelty/}}

